{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Pushed as Gerrit change 3474. make verify: 1 failed, 21561 passed, then 226 integration passed. The single failure (test_repair_pause_ownership_store in_flight[doctor]) is a git update-ref exceeding the 5 s ref-lock bound while 3 verifies loaded the host. It touches no file this change edits, and the module passed 3 times in isolation. Filed as ingenious-prudish-squamata. Reproduction for this ticket: on macOS with the Windows branch forced, both goose binding tests pass."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795144986864121001,"uuid":"a0c0aff4-7eb8-42a3-ae19-5de40cf7a910"}